WEBVTT

00:13.560 --> 00:15.080
Look at the pinwheel drums!

00:15.080 --> 00:18.500
(Premium Medicinal Herbs)

00:27.520 --> 00:28.800
What's wrong with the child?

00:28.816 --> 00:29.930
What's wrong with the child?

00:30.120 --> 00:31.070
Quick, take a look!

00:31.710 --> 00:33.670
He suddenly collapsed
while he was walking.

00:33.670 --> 00:34.840
Whose child is this?

00:35.470 --> 00:36.470
Poor thing.

00:46.620 --> 00:49.060
(Baicao Herb House)

01:13.680 --> 01:14.920
Thank you all for saving me.

01:15.310 --> 01:16.560
If the opportunity ever arises,

01:16.920 --> 01:18.710
I'll surely repay your kindness one day.

01:19.510 --> 01:20.400
It was nothing.

01:20.480 --> 01:21.648
There's no need to repay us.

01:22.560 --> 01:23.200
Zhen Zhu.

01:23.760 --> 01:24.710
Leave him some money.

01:25.710 --> 01:26.760
I'm not a beggar.

01:26.760 --> 01:27.680
I don't want charity.

01:31.790 --> 01:32.560
My father

01:32.640 --> 01:33.920
was once a military commander.

01:34.350 --> 01:35.680
He died in battle two years ago.

01:36.640 --> 01:38.150
My mother was heartbroken

01:38.310 --> 01:39.400
and followed him in death.

01:40.150 --> 01:40.870
After that,

01:40.870 --> 01:42.640
I was sent to Gudu Garden.

01:42.656 --> 01:44.760
The wages I earn carrying cargo
at the docks are enough

01:45.040 --> 01:46.230
to support myself.

01:47.310 --> 01:48.510
What's Gudu Garden?

01:48.640 --> 01:51.280
It's a place that takes in the
orphaned children of fallen soldiers.

03:12.820 --> 03:13.570
=Blossoms of Power=

03:13.584 --> 03:16.420
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:16.500 --> 03:19.460
=Episode 7=

03:19.860 --> 03:22.140
(Gudu Garden)

03:30.190 --> 03:31.630
Liang, let me help.

03:31.800 --> 03:32.870
Pack that a little tighter.

03:34.240 --> 03:34.840
Well done.

03:34.912 --> 03:36.320
You'll make a fine soldier someday.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.430
Bring two more.

03:40.520 --> 03:41.000
Come on.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.120
Lay it a little thicker here.

03:42.120 --> 03:44.320
Don't let the storm
leave the children out in the cold.

03:44.336 --> 03:44.992
All right.

03:51.710 --> 03:52.800
Spread it out evenly.

03:52.800 --> 03:53.430
All right.

03:53.520 --> 03:54.240
Yes, over here.

03:54.240 --> 03:54.680
Got it.

03:54.960 --> 03:55.430
Pull.

03:56.784 --> 03:57.630
I'll get that for you.

03:57.664 --> 03:58.560
Tie it down securely.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.240
There.

04:00.310 --> 04:01.080
Go get some rest.

04:06.400 --> 04:06.840
Come here.

04:07.536 --> 04:08.280
Let me take a look.

04:12.750 --> 04:13.630
Careful.

04:15.910 --> 04:16.680
Slowly.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.000
Your Highness,

04:18.390 --> 04:19.480
please let me do it.

04:19.480 --> 04:20.740
These children are badly injured.

04:20.750 --> 04:21.800
Your status is too noble.

04:21.800 --> 04:23.296
No need
for you to do this yourself.

04:27.088 --> 04:28.510
Have you forgotten why these children

04:28.510 --> 04:29.480
became orphans?

04:30.336 --> 04:32.176
If their fathers
hadn't fought so bravely,

04:32.180 --> 04:34.160
defending our nation
and laying down their lives,

04:34.310 --> 04:35.720
they could have lived carefree lives.

04:37.264 --> 04:39.024
What right do I have
to shrink from this?

04:39.830 --> 04:41.000
I spoke out of turn.

04:41.248 --> 04:42.656
I'm willing to accept punishment.

04:42.830 --> 04:44.160
Report back for twenty strokes.

04:44.272 --> 04:45.216
Yes, Your Highness.

04:48.120 --> 04:48.510
Come.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.192
Let me put some ointment on it.

04:51.390 --> 04:51.750
No.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.510
I don't want to.

04:52.510 --> 04:53.136
It hurts.

04:53.184 --> 04:54.144
You're a brave young man.

04:54.176 --> 04:55.470
A real man doesn't cry over blood.

04:55.480 --> 04:56.340
What's a little pain?

04:56.360 --> 04:56.800
Hold still.

05:00.310 --> 05:01.560
I don't want to!

05:10.560 --> 05:11.600
Putting on ointment hurts.

05:12.160 --> 05:13.600
That's why I brought candied fruit.

05:14.630 --> 05:17.040
The bravest child gets three pieces.

05:17.800 --> 05:20.040
The ones who aren't
as brave only get one.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.510
So,

05:21.600 --> 05:22.950
are you the bravest child?

05:27.360 --> 05:28.680
I'm the bravest.

05:30.040 --> 05:30.510
Come on.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.040
Go play.

05:54.768 --> 05:56.000
Thank you for your help today.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.920
Think nothing of it.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.680
I still owe you

05:59.830 --> 06:01.390
my thanks for the Anxi Defense Map.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.190
However,

06:03.630 --> 06:05.680
I have another favor to ask today.

06:05.680 --> 06:06.480
Please, go ahead.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.160
This child is exceptionally gifted.

06:17.310 --> 06:19.070
Though still young,
he's proud and unyielding.

06:19.080 --> 06:20.320
He refuses to be bent by poverty.

06:20.336 --> 06:21.480
He's a born soldier.

06:21.870 --> 06:23.160
I'd like to ask you

06:23.160 --> 06:25.070
to take him to
the army camp for training.

06:25.190 --> 06:26.430
If you think so highly of him,

06:26.720 --> 06:28.070
he must be exceptional.

06:29.560 --> 06:30.040
Very well.

06:30.310 --> 06:31.270
I'll take him in.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.830
A soldier without a strategy

06:32.830 --> 06:34.000
is nothing more than a brute.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.750
Besides teaching him martial arts,

06:35.750 --> 06:37.240
please also teach him to read and write

06:37.250 --> 06:38.370
and study military strategy.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.870
I won't let you down.

06:39.904 --> 06:41.390
Since you've been blessed with talent,

06:41.390 --> 06:42.560
make the most of it.

06:42.640 --> 06:44.448
Study hard
and master every skill you can.

06:44.680 --> 06:45.630
When you grow up,

06:45.630 --> 06:47.680
become a soldier like your father,

06:47.680 --> 06:49.344
standing tall with unwavering resolve.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.040
Yes.

06:50.096 --> 06:51.240
Rest assured, Your Highness.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.240
I'll study hard.

06:53.560 --> 06:54.600
Go pack your things.

07:02.270 --> 07:03.240
It's getting late.

07:03.310 --> 07:04.240
I should be going now.

07:06.390 --> 07:07.000
Your Highness.

07:09.264 --> 07:10.560
There's something I'd like to ask.

07:11.510 --> 07:12.630
Please, go ahead.

07:16.016 --> 07:18.270
Gudu Garden, which shelters
fallen soldiers' orphans,

07:18.600 --> 07:20.360
has always been funded by the military.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.830
Today,

07:23.024 --> 07:25.792
I saw with my own eyes how neglected
and run-down this place has become.

07:26.270 --> 07:27.310
It made me wonder...

07:27.680 --> 07:29.600
If even the meager funds for Gudu Garden

07:29.600 --> 07:30.992
have been embezzled to this extent,

07:31.328 --> 07:34.304
What about military supplies, which cost
hundreds or thousands of times more?

07:34.640 --> 07:36.480
Could they have also been embezzled?

07:37.088 --> 07:38.600
You have been thinking about this too?

07:40.512 --> 07:42.190
A few coins
in a corrupt official's pocket

07:42.360 --> 07:44.190
could mean several lives lost in battle.

07:45.720 --> 07:47.190
But this is only my suspicion.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.920
So I'd like to ask your brother

07:48.976 --> 07:51.360
to secretly investigate
the military supplies in northwest.

07:51.720 --> 07:53.190
I'll also conduct

07:53.216 --> 07:54.640
a thorough inspection of my own camps.

07:54.720 --> 07:55.630
It's a worthy cause.

07:56.070 --> 07:57.950
I'll write to my brother
as soon as I return.

07:58.390 --> 07:59.750
I won't let you down.

08:00.950 --> 08:01.750
Thank you.

08:12.830 --> 08:13.480
Your Highness,

08:13.950 --> 08:15.240
don't you think

08:15.240 --> 08:17.560
the heavenly maidens in temple murals

08:17.950 --> 08:18.680
must look

08:18.800 --> 08:20.240
just like the Commandery Princess?

08:23.310 --> 08:24.680
To most people,

08:25.040 --> 08:26.390
the children of Gudu Garden

08:26.480 --> 08:27.830
are as insignificant as ants,

08:27.872 --> 08:29.520
deserving contempt more than pity.

08:29.792 --> 08:31.504
The Commandery Princess
is not only kind,

08:31.750 --> 08:33.240
but also sees talent beyond status.

08:33.870 --> 08:36.080
She has never looked down on
those of humble birth.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.270
I truly admire her.

08:39.664 --> 08:42.080
The Noble Consort always says
she wants to find Your Highness

08:42.080 --> 08:44.630
the finest noble lady
in the imperial capital.

08:45.840 --> 08:47.080
But if you ask me,

08:47.360 --> 08:50.120
only the Commandery Princess
is worthy of Your Highness.

08:56.670 --> 08:58.600
I'm the one
who must become worthy of her.

09:04.750 --> 09:05.840
Vice Minister Cui said

09:06.270 --> 09:08.200
he thoroughly investigated Ye Qi.

09:08.640 --> 09:09.990
(Auspicious Radiance)
He found the Hexi Army

09:10.000 --> 09:10.860
under Ye Qi's command

09:11.270 --> 09:12.910
had top-quality weapons

09:13.440 --> 09:14.480
and warhorses,

09:15.120 --> 09:16.600
on par with the Imperial Guard.

09:18.480 --> 09:19.670
With an army this strong,

09:20.390 --> 09:22.440
it's no wonder he wants
to replace the Duke of Wei.

09:23.550 --> 09:25.960
But as Commander-in-Chief of Hexi,

09:27.120 --> 09:28.550
where did he get so much money?

09:29.240 --> 09:30.320
More than ten years ago,

09:30.480 --> 09:32.030
Ye Qi rescued a minor official

09:32.030 --> 09:34.120
in charge of the local
horse administration in Anxi.

09:34.192 --> 09:36.630
The man was exceptionally capable
and rose through the ranks.

09:36.750 --> 09:38.360
With Ye Qi's backing,

09:38.670 --> 09:40.840
he rose from
a horse administration official

09:41.480 --> 09:42.840
to Minister of Revenue.

09:43.390 --> 09:44.750
Minister of Revenue...

09:46.510 --> 09:47.270
Dong Biquan?

09:51.720 --> 09:53.270
If Ye Qi amassed that much wealth,

09:53.344 --> 09:54.910
he most likely embezzled military funds.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.240
Dong Biquan

09:56.240 --> 09:57.600
would naturally turn a blind eye.

09:59.270 --> 09:59.790
Your Highness,

10:00.670 --> 10:01.720
I've long heard

10:01.910 --> 10:04.304
that officials
in local horse administration

10:04.310 --> 10:06.260
often lend horses
to foreign merchants in secret

10:06.270 --> 10:07.510
to transport tribute goods.

10:08.150 --> 10:08.960
It seems

10:09.360 --> 10:10.360
Dong Biquan

10:10.416 --> 10:12.240
must have had
plenty of dealings with them.

10:12.848 --> 10:14.352
If we're investigating the poison,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.720
that's another lead to follow.

10:18.752 --> 10:20.688
The autumn grain shipment is due soon.

10:21.480 --> 10:22.750
If we're going after Dong Biquan,

10:23.960 --> 10:25.270
let's send this year's grain

10:25.750 --> 10:27.030
to the right place.

10:33.600 --> 10:35.200
Prince Lie asked my brother

10:35.200 --> 10:37.152
to investigate
the military supplies and payroll.

10:37.390 --> 10:38.750
He wrote back

10:38.960 --> 10:40.840
that only half
of this year's military funds

10:40.910 --> 10:41.910
ever reached northwest.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.670
I wonder how things are in Shunan.

10:45.150 --> 10:46.200
The same as every year.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.960
The military budget has been skimmed.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.120
The grain and cloth

10:49.120 --> 10:50.384
are always inferior substitutes.

10:50.480 --> 10:51.750
Why not report it to the court?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.840
Everyone knows what's going on.

10:53.840 --> 10:54.840
It's the same every year.

10:55.200 --> 10:56.510
Losses in transit,

10:56.510 --> 10:58.030
and poor-quality supplies.

10:58.030 --> 10:59.540
They have no shortage of excuses.

10:59.550 --> 11:01.630
If you accept them,
they'll deny everything afterward.

11:01.630 --> 11:03.720
But if you insist on checking
everything before accepting it,

11:03.720 --> 11:05.232
they'll drag it out until you give up.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.750
And if you make too much of it,

11:06.750 --> 11:07.360
they might even

11:07.600 --> 11:08.790
turn the blame on you.

11:09.870 --> 11:11.320
Now that the realm is at peace,

11:12.128 --> 11:13.670
the damage from embezzled military funds

11:13.910 --> 11:15.360
isn't obvious.

11:15.720 --> 11:17.790
But if disaster or war breaks out,

11:17.960 --> 11:19.000
and the treasury runs dry,

11:19.408 --> 11:20.840
it will become the root of chaos.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.320
In truth, every military camp
wants to investigate.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.910
But the Ministry of Revenue is airtight.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.080
There's simply no way in.

11:28.000 --> 11:29.030
Then...

11:29.030 --> 11:30.360
let's start with Gudu Garden.

11:31.870 --> 11:32.670
Gudu Garden?

11:33.776 --> 11:35.960
Gudu Garden is also funded
by the military budget.

11:36.150 --> 11:37.480
And it's the least noticeable

11:37.480 --> 11:38.910
and most overlooked branch.

11:39.600 --> 11:41.080
Prince Lie and I both believe

11:41.270 --> 11:42.510
it's full of loopholes,

11:42.510 --> 11:44.512
making it the easiest place
to uncover evidence.

11:44.630 --> 11:46.080
A fine idea.

11:48.670 --> 11:49.390
However,

11:50.150 --> 11:52.750
since when did you and Prince Lie

11:52.750 --> 11:53.630
start working together?

11:55.320 --> 11:57.320
Prince Lie may seem hot-tempered,

11:57.670 --> 11:59.200
but he's an honorable man at heart.

11:59.750 --> 12:01.960
We're not close.

12:02.720 --> 12:03.720
We just happened

12:03.870 --> 12:05.360
to work on the same case.

12:05.510 --> 12:08.270
You're closest to the Crown Prince.

12:10.090 --> 12:12.670
You see that he's frail
and want to find a backup.

12:12.670 --> 12:14.032
You're playing both sides.

12:15.480 --> 12:16.790
Never mind playing both sides.

12:17.240 --> 12:19.720
What if I were to explore
a few more options?

12:21.750 --> 12:24.030
That's what I like about you.

12:24.270 --> 12:25.630
Any other young lady,

12:25.630 --> 12:26.910
if she had such thoughts,

12:26.910 --> 12:28.150
would keep them to herself.

12:28.150 --> 12:29.200
But you're different.

12:29.200 --> 12:31.536
You don't hide a thing.
You're completely open about it.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.720
Why haven't you
changed your Spring Snow Fragrance?

12:44.630 --> 12:46.000
My mother passed away young.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.150
It was

12:47.630 --> 12:49.200
her favorite fragrance.

12:51.480 --> 12:53.870
I know you keep wearing it
to remember her.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.030
But your mother

12:56.510 --> 12:58.870
would never want you
to expose yourself because of her

12:58.870 --> 13:00.150
and bring death upon yourself.

13:01.390 --> 13:02.630
I have an idea.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.550
I can use Spring Snow Fragrance
as the base note

13:05.870 --> 13:07.790
to create a fragrance for men.

13:08.440 --> 13:09.120
That way,

13:09.240 --> 13:10.960
you can wear it openly from now on.

13:14.440 --> 13:15.910
Thank you, Xihe.

13:17.480 --> 13:18.320
Don't thank me.

13:19.000 --> 13:21.120
Just send me
those 3000 elite troops sooner.

13:28.688 --> 13:29.392
Your Highness,

13:29.400 --> 13:30.670
the Commandery Princess's people

13:30.670 --> 13:32.320
have started looking into Gudu Garden.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.870
Gudu Garden?

13:43.000 --> 13:44.240
Dong Biquan

13:45.088 --> 13:47.168
keeps the Ministry of Revenue
under tight control.

13:47.184 --> 13:48.700
No matter how thorough my arrangements,

13:48.720 --> 13:50.448
there are always
things I can't account for.

13:51.270 --> 13:52.960
An overlooked place like Gudu Garden

13:52.960 --> 13:54.790
is the perfect place
to follow the trail.

13:56.390 --> 13:56.840
Wait.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.960
Quietly let Dong Biquan know

14:02.000 --> 14:03.510
that Gudu Garden is being investigated.

14:04.840 --> 14:05.870
Only when cornered

14:05.904 --> 14:07.120
will he take desperate measures.

14:07.390 --> 14:08.000
Go.

14:09.504 --> 14:10.544
Yes, Your Highness.

14:16.550 --> 14:19.030
First someone hijacked
the military supplies,

14:19.440 --> 14:22.000
and now they're
investigating Gudu Garden.

14:22.270 --> 14:24.320
They're leaving me no way out!

14:24.750 --> 14:25.440
Minister Dong,

14:25.960 --> 14:28.150
the grain shipment was already short

14:28.150 --> 14:29.150
when it left our hands.

14:29.360 --> 14:30.840
If they launch a full investigation,

14:31.000 --> 14:32.440
His Majesty will surely find out.

14:32.750 --> 14:35.270
If we fail to recover it,
we'll be blamed for negligence.

14:35.870 --> 14:37.550
But if they do recover it,

14:37.910 --> 14:39.080
it'll be even worse.

14:40.630 --> 14:43.150
All the embezzlement

14:43.630 --> 14:44.960
will come to light.

14:45.120 --> 14:45.910
For now,

14:46.720 --> 14:48.630
we have to pay for it ourselves

14:48.870 --> 14:50.440
and replace the stolen grain.

14:50.670 --> 14:52.240
Keep people from talking.

14:53.150 --> 14:54.150
Replace it?

14:54.600 --> 14:55.440
We...

14:55.910 --> 14:58.320
can buy grain cheaply from elsewhere

14:58.576 --> 15:00.270
and make up part of the shortage first.

15:00.750 --> 15:02.320
That'll keep the army from unrest.

15:02.870 --> 15:05.670
Once we're through this,

15:06.120 --> 15:07.790
we'll make a long-term plan.

15:20.670 --> 15:21.360
Tian Yuan.

15:21.870 --> 15:23.630
Go find a grain merchant
for Dong Biquan.

15:23.870 --> 15:25.840
Let him buy enough low-priced grain

15:25.840 --> 15:26.992
to cover the shortage.

15:27.480 --> 15:28.510
Once the deal is done,

15:28.670 --> 15:30.750
go to the prison and find two inmates.

15:31.510 --> 15:32.320
Understood.

15:36.410 --> 15:39.168
The Commandery Princess has been
relentlessly investigating Gudu Garden.

15:39.170 --> 15:40.570
Dong Biquan had a guilty conscience.

15:41.150 --> 15:43.200
That gave him the final push.

15:43.360 --> 15:44.870
Speeding up his downfall.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.440
Once again, I've seen firsthand

15:47.568 --> 15:50.976
that your strategies are every bit
the equal of the Commandery Princess's.

15:54.870 --> 15:56.150
As if fate itself,

15:56.840 --> 15:58.840
we're destined to walk the same path.

15:58.960 --> 15:59.600
Your Highness,

15:59.600 --> 16:01.000
why make it sound so complicated?

16:01.270 --> 16:02.000
Just say it.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.032
You think everything
about her is wonderful.

16:11.500 --> 16:13.380
(Taiji Hall)

16:13.390 --> 16:14.440
Your Majesty,

16:14.790 --> 16:15.550
five days ago,

16:16.030 --> 16:19.030
two convicted prisoners escaped
from the prison outside the capital.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.270
In the end,

16:20.600 --> 16:22.630
they were captured
at an abandoned estate

16:22.630 --> 16:23.630
outside the capital.

16:24.150 --> 16:25.080
Not only that,

16:25.720 --> 16:28.320
but several hundred dan
of grain were also found there.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.630
The grain sacks

16:31.270 --> 16:33.000
bore the markings of tax grain.

16:35.320 --> 16:37.390
Who owns that estate?

16:38.240 --> 16:39.488
Our investigation found

16:39.870 --> 16:42.360
it belongs to Dong Biquan,
Minister of Revenue.

16:48.910 --> 16:50.360
Your Majesty,

16:50.360 --> 16:52.464
I do own an estate outside the capital,

16:52.496 --> 16:54.840
but I've been tied up
with official duties all these years

16:54.840 --> 16:56.160
and have no time to look after it.

16:56.170 --> 16:57.670
So I simply let it fall into disrepair.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.030
I believe

16:59.150 --> 17:01.870
someone may have thought
it was abandoned,

17:01.870 --> 17:03.030
occupied it without permission,

17:03.030 --> 17:04.510
and used it for criminal activities.

17:04.510 --> 17:05.830
That is entirely possible.

17:06.680 --> 17:07.440
Your Majesty,

17:07.920 --> 17:09.880
there are countless estates
outside the capital.

17:10.200 --> 17:11.720
Why did those two convicts

17:11.720 --> 17:13.680
just happen to flee to mine,

17:14.160 --> 17:16.680
and expose a stash of tax grain there?

17:16.680 --> 17:17.960
I believe

17:19.270 --> 17:22.000
someone deliberately framed me.

17:22.510 --> 17:24.750
I beg Your Majesty to see the truth.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.400
Vice Minister Cui.

17:27.328 --> 17:28.416
Yes, Your Majesty.

17:35.030 --> 17:36.400
Do you have any evidence

17:36.680 --> 17:39.590
proving the tax grain
is connected to Minister Dong?

17:41.070 --> 17:42.200
Your Majesty,

17:43.720 --> 17:44.960
a grain merchant from Jiangnan

17:44.960 --> 17:47.920
has submitted evidence that Minister
Dong intended to sell him grain.

17:47.952 --> 17:49.632
Every piece of evidence is conclusive.

17:49.920 --> 17:51.110
And the amount of grain

17:51.110 --> 17:53.590
matches exactly what was found
at Minister Dong's estate.

17:53.790 --> 17:54.480
I'm innocent!

17:54.720 --> 17:56.920
I... I truly am innocent!

18:01.110 --> 18:02.880
I wasn't trying to sell grain.

18:04.160 --> 18:06.480
I was trying to buy it.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.270
Why were you buying grain?

18:11.400 --> 18:12.240
Your Majesty,

18:12.350 --> 18:14.160
after the autumn
grain shipment was seized,

18:14.208 --> 18:15.720
I...

18:16.000 --> 18:18.750
I feared... feared Your Majesty
would be worried.

18:18.750 --> 18:19.750
So I thought

18:20.440 --> 18:22.550
I'd first purchase part
of the autumn grain,

18:23.510 --> 18:24.720
allocate it to the military,

18:25.160 --> 18:26.640
and keep morale steady.

18:27.160 --> 18:29.200
The autumn grain was seized.
This is no small matter.

18:29.680 --> 18:31.750
Yet Minister Dong
tried to cover it up on his own.

18:32.270 --> 18:32.880
May I ask,

18:33.640 --> 18:34.960
where did the money come from?

18:40.030 --> 18:41.000
Your Majesty,

18:41.552 --> 18:43.808
if the Ministry of Revenue
has embezzled public funds,

18:44.110 --> 18:46.160
it will spread panic
throughout the court

18:46.160 --> 18:48.680
and even among the common people.

18:49.270 --> 18:52.030
This is a crime that threatens
the very foundation of the realm.

18:52.640 --> 18:53.960
I request

18:54.750 --> 18:57.030
a full investigation
of the Ministry of Revenue.

18:58.560 --> 19:00.688
- Your Majesty, authorize
- Your Majesty, authorize

19:00.736 --> 19:02.110
- a full investigation
- a full investigation

19:02.112 --> 19:04.110
- into the Ministry of Revenue.
- into the Ministry of Revenue.

19:06.310 --> 19:07.070
Granted.

19:30.640 --> 19:32.680
What brings the Crown Prince here?

19:32.896 --> 19:34.510
The Ministry of Revenue's corruption,

19:35.880 --> 19:37.270
the empty treasury,

19:38.030 --> 19:39.440
and Ye Qi's rise to power

19:40.400 --> 19:42.240
were all brought
about by you, Minister Dong.

19:43.350 --> 19:44.680
Your Highness,

19:46.070 --> 19:49.070
you actually knew
about my connection to Ye Qi.

19:55.550 --> 19:59.000
You planned all of this
from the very beginning.

19:59.440 --> 20:01.110
After the autumn grain was seized,

20:01.510 --> 20:03.590
I thought replacing the missing grain

20:03.590 --> 20:05.480
would be enough to cover it up.

20:06.200 --> 20:08.590
Instead, you turned it
into irrefutable evidence.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.830
Whether it was embezzling
the autumn grain

20:12.830 --> 20:14.400
or siphoning off military supplies,

20:14.960 --> 20:16.400
both are capital crimes.

20:17.070 --> 20:20.270
I underestimated you.

20:21.110 --> 20:21.920
Minister Dong,

20:22.830 --> 20:24.920
what's the point
of dwelling on that now?

20:26.400 --> 20:27.750
Your crimes are beyond forgiveness.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.790
But if you answer my question...

20:32.550 --> 20:34.440
I can spare the rest of your household.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.830
What does Your Highness wish to know?

20:44.200 --> 20:46.030
There is a rare poison
from the Western Regions.

20:46.790 --> 20:49.510
It is made from more than a dozen
poisons from Persia and the Uyghurs.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.030
It is exceedingly rare.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.720
Its effects can only
be suppressed temporarily.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.920
It can never be fully cured.

20:56.544 --> 20:59.120
When you oversaw horse affairs
at the Court of Imperial Stables,

20:59.184 --> 21:00.960
did you ever hear of such a poison?

21:01.720 --> 21:04.310
I once knew

21:04.720 --> 21:07.480
a foreign merchant
who dealt in banned drugs.

21:07.640 --> 21:10.110
He mentioned a rare poison
from the Western Regions.

21:10.590 --> 21:13.480
It sounded very much like
what Your Highness described.

21:13.720 --> 21:14.880
What is his name?

21:16.000 --> 21:17.030
What does he look like?

21:17.110 --> 21:19.550
Which market did he frequent?
Which trade route did he travel?

21:19.550 --> 21:20.790
Tell me everything you remember.

21:20.920 --> 21:22.590
Leave nothing out.

21:25.750 --> 21:30.240
Can Your Highness
truly spare my wife and children?

21:37.480 --> 21:38.030
Believe me,

21:39.070 --> 21:40.550
and there may still be hope.

21:41.728 --> 21:44.070
If not, your entire household
will still face execution.

21:49.270 --> 21:49.960
There's no rush.

21:52.440 --> 21:54.240
Think it over carefully, Minister Dong.

21:55.620 --> 21:58.980
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

22:00.030 --> 22:02.920
I heard His Majesty praised
Crown Prince's benevolence today.

22:03.750 --> 22:04.590
Indeed.

22:05.510 --> 22:06.590
Benevolent to the very end.

22:07.720 --> 22:09.440
That doesn't sound

22:09.680 --> 22:11.750
like your true opinion, Your Highness.

22:12.440 --> 22:13.310
Why not?

22:13.952 --> 22:14.880
Toward his officials,

22:14.912 --> 22:17.440
he argued that the families should not
be punished for their crimes

22:17.440 --> 22:18.780
and spared their wives and children.

22:18.860 --> 22:20.150
A display of mercy and compassion.

22:20.160 --> 22:20.790
(Fucui Pavilion)

22:20.816 --> 22:21.680
Toward the military,

22:21.760 --> 22:24.608
he donated the East Palace's own wealth
to replenish military provisions,

22:24.640 --> 22:26.640
steadying morale and putting
the greater good first.

22:27.110 --> 22:28.030
Toward His Majesty,

22:28.080 --> 22:30.832
he proposed that military supplies
be distributed on schedule,

22:30.912 --> 22:33.100
showing the responsibility
expected of the heir apparent.

22:33.240 --> 22:35.480
From top to bottom, inside and out,

22:35.590 --> 22:37.232
no one has a bad word to say about him.

22:38.510 --> 22:40.000
Nor can anyone find reason to doubt him.

22:40.640 --> 22:41.830
What I cannot tell is

22:42.240 --> 22:43.510
whether all of this

22:43.790 --> 22:45.110
comes from genuine benevolence,

22:45.720 --> 22:47.200
or from a masterfully laid scheme.

22:48.480 --> 22:49.480
Your Highness,

22:50.110 --> 22:51.550
could the Crown Prince

22:51.550 --> 22:53.750
really be that calculating?

22:54.920 --> 22:56.640
Aren't we living proof?

22:56.976 --> 22:58.750
Even now, we still
can't see through him.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.030
Xihe.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.640
Have you heard?

23:04.750 --> 23:05.750
His Majesty has ordered

23:05.750 --> 23:07.030
that military grain supplies
be fully replenished.

23:07.160 --> 23:07.920
I have.

23:07.920 --> 23:08.830
It's good news.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.350
I told my father

23:10.350 --> 23:11.310
about it.

23:11.680 --> 23:12.790
He told me to pay my respects

23:12.790 --> 23:14.576
to the soldiers
of Shunan who fell in battle.

23:14.608 --> 23:16.030
Would you like to come with me?

23:16.032 --> 23:17.472
To pay tribute to the fallen soldiers?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.070
That's right.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.928
Didn't the Duke of Wei

23:20.944 --> 23:23.680
also ask you to honor
the fallen soldiers of northwest?

23:24.160 --> 23:25.440
Of course he did.

23:26.070 --> 23:27.160
In that case,

23:27.400 --> 23:28.350
let's go together.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.070
All right.

23:30.580 --> 23:37.340
(Loyal Souls Shine Forever)

23:51.880 --> 23:52.750
Your Highness.

24:02.030 --> 24:03.240
Greetings, Prince Lie.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.110
Greetings, Your Highness.

24:07.200 --> 24:10.510
Are you here to pay tribute
to the fallen soldiers as well?

24:10.510 --> 24:11.030
Yes.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.160
My father always told me

24:12.160 --> 24:14.000
to come here every Qingming and
Ghost Festival to pay tribute to them.

24:14.070 --> 24:15.552
It's the same
for Commandery Princess.

24:15.584 --> 24:18.304
The Duke and the Marquis love their
country as they do their own family

24:18.310 --> 24:20.112
and cherish their soldiers
like their own sons.

24:20.120 --> 24:21.424
I have nothing but admiration.

24:23.160 --> 24:24.240
Why is

24:24.480 --> 24:25.480
this tomb empty?

24:31.830 --> 24:33.790
The soldiers fought bravely
on the battlefield.

24:34.030 --> 24:35.830
Many of them could not
even have their remains

24:35.830 --> 24:36.790
brought home for burial.

24:37.400 --> 24:38.550
All that could be laid to rest

24:38.960 --> 24:40.400
were broken arrows and jade pendants.

24:43.472 --> 24:45.240
They were heroes
who defended our country,

24:46.048 --> 24:48.672
and brothers who fought beside me
through life and death.

24:49.472 --> 24:51.392
Even if all that remains
is a single keepsake

24:51.830 --> 24:52.830
or a letter from home,

24:54.480 --> 24:56.480
I will bring it back
and give them a proper burial,

24:57.680 --> 24:59.712
so future generations
will remember them.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.640
Well said, Your Highness.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.640
Now that Dong Biquan has fallen,

25:07.776 --> 25:10.208
the funds withheld from Gudu Garden
have finally been restored.

25:11.160 --> 25:12.240
We owe it all to you.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.510
On behalf

25:13.888 --> 25:16.384
of the fallen soldiers
and the orphans they left behind,

25:17.888 --> 25:19.110
I offer my deepest thanks.

25:24.270 --> 25:25.400
Your hand is injured.

25:28.384 --> 25:29.270
It's only a scratch.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.160
It's nothing.

25:31.270 --> 25:31.830
Mo Yu,

25:32.640 --> 25:33.720
bring me the medicine kit.

26:22.110 --> 26:22.640
All done.

26:24.550 --> 26:25.480
Thank you.

26:42.070 --> 26:44.590
He's truly a remarkable young man.

26:45.000 --> 26:46.440
Among all the princes,

26:46.720 --> 26:48.960
Prince Lie is a rare military talent.

26:50.000 --> 26:52.440
It's rare to hear you speak
so highly of someone.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.200
Xihe, you may not know this.

26:54.270 --> 26:56.480
Prince Lie's maternal family,
the Rong family,

26:56.480 --> 26:57.776
comes from a family of generals.

26:57.920 --> 26:59.680
His maternal grandfather, General Rong,

26:59.680 --> 27:00.640
fell in battle.

27:01.030 --> 27:02.440
Of his four sons,

27:02.680 --> 27:03.790
two died in battle.

27:04.030 --> 27:04.960
A family of heroes.

27:05.472 --> 27:06.896
The Crown Prince is in frail health.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.240
If he were to die young,

27:08.240 --> 27:09.070
everyone knows

27:09.070 --> 27:10.550
Prince Xin is more than capable.

27:11.000 --> 27:11.880
Otherwise,

27:11.880 --> 27:14.510
His Majesty would never have
let the Rong family and Prince Lie

27:14.510 --> 27:16.240
hold military command for so many years.

27:20.270 --> 27:22.880
I just saw that Xihe seems to admire

27:22.880 --> 27:23.830
Prince Lie quite a bit.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.350
You're from northwest.

27:25.790 --> 27:28.550
Could it be that you prefer
more masculine men?

27:31.000 --> 27:32.480
Do not presume to know another's heart.

27:33.110 --> 27:35.640
Simply wait and see.

27:49.790 --> 27:50.310
Please.

28:00.288 --> 28:02.272
Crown Prince
always keeps his plans well hidden.

28:02.550 --> 28:04.000
He rarely summons all of us together.

28:04.680 --> 28:06.160
Is there something urgent today?

28:06.750 --> 28:07.790
These past few days,

28:09.472 --> 28:12.200
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
and Changying have grown quite close.

28:12.830 --> 28:13.920
And Zhaoning...

28:15.590 --> 28:17.440
It's hard for any man
not to fall for her.

28:21.000 --> 28:21.680
Your Highness,

28:22.310 --> 28:23.070
how about

28:23.270 --> 28:25.550
arranging an unmatched beauty
for Prince Lie?

28:26.110 --> 28:26.960
You mean...

28:28.440 --> 28:29.240
using a honey trap?

28:31.590 --> 28:33.680
I don't like using women
to achieve my goals.

28:34.790 --> 28:35.590
In this world,

28:36.440 --> 28:38.550
life is already unfair enough for women.

28:39.110 --> 28:40.160
I'd rather

28:40.920 --> 28:42.000
make use of men.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.400
A handsome man trap?

28:47.720 --> 28:48.440
Me?

28:48.576 --> 28:49.920
Your martial arts are exceptional.

28:50.016 --> 28:51.360
Changying admires martial prowess.

28:51.440 --> 28:53.776
Prince Lie is well-versed
in every style of martial arts.

28:54.070 --> 28:55.680
After no more than five exchanges,

28:55.904 --> 28:57.590
he would figure out where I came from.

28:57.720 --> 28:58.830
I'm afraid...

28:59.350 --> 29:01.030
I could never escape his notice.

29:05.344 --> 29:07.440
I'd like to help ease
Your Highness's burden as well.

29:07.830 --> 29:10.100
It's just that Bu Shulin follows me
around every single day.

29:10.128 --> 29:11.312
Wherever I go, he goes.

29:11.320 --> 29:13.480
If I start meeting with Prince Lie,

29:13.552 --> 29:15.232
he'll definitely come and make trouble.

29:31.968 --> 29:34.010
Why are the three of you
looking at me like that?

29:34.030 --> 29:34.880
Your Highness,

29:35.790 --> 29:37.240
the three of us are all in agreement.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.440
This time,

29:39.270 --> 29:40.590
you'll have to handle it yourself.

29:43.500 --> 29:46.620
(Moyang Martial Hall)

29:53.160 --> 29:53.640
You.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.200
Don't move.

29:56.000 --> 29:56.510
Turn around.

29:56.750 --> 29:57.550
Who are you?

30:03.750 --> 30:05.110
You're just a sickly invalid.

30:07.000 --> 30:08.640
Hand over
everything valuable you've got.

30:08.784 --> 30:09.920
Don't make me do it myself.

30:09.984 --> 30:12.256
It's the imperial capital,
right beneath His Majesty's rule,

30:12.256 --> 30:13.510
and you're robbing me
in broad daylight?

30:13.510 --> 30:14.480
Quit dragging this out.

30:14.480 --> 30:15.240
(Crown Prince?)

30:15.240 --> 30:15.830
Hand it over.

30:17.640 --> 30:18.270
Is that all?

30:18.480 --> 30:19.550
That's really everything.

30:19.920 --> 30:21.200
Just so you won't report me,

30:21.350 --> 30:22.480
I'll send you on your way!

31:45.510 --> 31:47.030
Thank you for coming to my aid in time.

31:47.640 --> 31:49.110
If you hadn't arrived when you did,

31:49.110 --> 31:50.704
I would've been powerless to resist.

31:53.030 --> 31:54.160
There's no need to thank me.

31:54.500 --> 31:56.560
I'll have someone
escort you back to the East Palace.

31:56.576 --> 31:57.340
I'll take my leave.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.070
Changying.

32:02.350 --> 32:03.550
Will you keep me company

32:05.310 --> 32:06.270
and have a drink with me

32:06.830 --> 32:07.590
to calm my nerves?

32:15.030 --> 32:15.680
Huayong,

32:16.350 --> 32:17.310
it's so late.

32:17.590 --> 32:18.750
Why did you come out alone?

32:18.750 --> 32:21.104
I was feeling stifled,
so I came out for some air. Come.

32:27.030 --> 32:28.400
With this frail body of mine,

32:28.590 --> 32:30.000
I can only drown my sorrows in liquor.

32:30.310 --> 32:31.270
Unlike you, Changying,

32:31.720 --> 32:34.030
a young general
galloping across the battlefield.

32:34.384 --> 32:35.904
How exhilarating that must be.

32:37.360 --> 32:39.008
Yet here I am in the imperial capital,

32:39.040 --> 32:40.790
unable to reclaim
our lost lands for Daxing

32:40.790 --> 32:41.750
or expand its borders.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.752
What kind of young general
does that make me?

32:47.240 --> 32:47.880
Huayong,

32:49.350 --> 32:50.350
do you truly

32:50.416 --> 32:52.640
intend to marry
Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

32:52.864 --> 32:54.560
To seek the hand of a lady in marriage

32:54.750 --> 32:55.680
is no trivial matter.

33:02.688 --> 33:05.328
We both seek the hand
of Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.640
Then let us compete honorably,

33:07.070 --> 33:08.070
open and aboveboard,

33:08.128 --> 33:09.728
each relying on his own merits.

33:09.744 --> 33:11.760
It need not damage
the bond between us as brothers.

33:12.480 --> 33:13.440
A true man

33:14.000 --> 33:15.680
should wield integrity as his sword.

33:16.680 --> 33:18.240
Even if one of us loses in love,

33:18.640 --> 33:20.880
we can still share
a drink beneath the rosy skies

33:21.280 --> 33:22.976
until we're both drunk
on the evening glow.

33:23.550 --> 33:24.310
Well said.

33:25.680 --> 33:26.270
Huayong,

33:27.070 --> 33:28.160
allow me to toast you.

33:30.000 --> 33:30.480
Come.

33:37.000 --> 33:37.720
Changying,

33:39.070 --> 33:40.440
will you accompany me tomorrow

33:41.000 --> 33:41.920
on a hunting trip?

33:52.440 --> 33:52.960
Changying,

33:53.024 --> 33:54.768
let's see which of us comes out on top.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.480
Come, Changying.

34:09.110 --> 34:09.510
Come.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.360
Huayong.

34:24.432 --> 34:25.800
There's an ancestral hall nearby.

34:25.888 --> 34:27.150
Why don't we take shelter there?

34:27.550 --> 34:28.030
All right.

34:31.030 --> 34:31.630
Let's go.

34:32.260 --> 34:38.100
(Loyalty Strong as Gold and Stone)

34:41.984 --> 34:43.800
"I would give my life
to save my country,

34:44.432 --> 34:46.110
and face death
as though returning home."

34:46.840 --> 34:47.760
This inscription

34:47.856 --> 34:49.824
(Meng Fei)
was written by General Meng himself.

34:50.190 --> 34:51.190
Its structure is upright,

34:51.328 --> 34:52.630
with powerful rhythm and flow.

34:52.640 --> 34:54.848
Only one who is truly loyal
to his sovereign and country

34:55.110 --> 34:56.670
could write such calligraphy.

34:58.150 --> 34:59.670
I can almost picture

35:00.190 --> 35:01.760
his brush dancing across the page.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.630
You're a young hero yourself.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.840
No wonder you understand how he felt.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.000
Huayong,

35:09.510 --> 35:10.920
you're giving me far too much credit.

35:12.000 --> 35:12.880
How could I

35:13.200 --> 35:15.150
possibly compare myself
to the Martial Saint?

35:16.480 --> 35:17.280
Why not?

35:18.360 --> 35:19.440
Before you were even fifteen,

35:19.840 --> 35:21.110
you could draw a 150 kg bow

35:21.232 --> 35:22.670
and wield an eight-stone crossbow.

35:22.816 --> 35:24.320
The whole realm was astonished.

35:24.592 --> 35:26.368
At seventeen,
you entered the battlefield

35:26.840 --> 35:29.030
and captured or slew
enemy generals time and again.

35:29.248 --> 35:30.510
Before you even turned twenty,

35:30.560 --> 35:32.160
you had already become
your grandfather's

35:32.208 --> 35:33.184
most trusted general.

35:33.440 --> 35:35.000
In the campaign against Wenyu,

35:35.510 --> 35:36.800
you won thirteen major victories

35:36.896 --> 35:38.768
and earned a legendary name
on the battlefield.

35:39.150 --> 35:40.800
I didn't expect you to remember so much.

35:41.216 --> 35:42.000
Far more than that.

35:42.032 --> 35:44.590
Your heroic deeds have long spread
throughout the imperial capital.

35:45.550 --> 35:46.510
Your grandfather

35:47.480 --> 35:48.590
was especially proud of you.

35:53.200 --> 35:54.920
My grandfather devoted his life to war.

35:56.230 --> 35:57.000
I remember

35:58.000 --> 35:59.550
the last time he marched into battle,

36:01.070 --> 36:02.480
he was already sixty-four years old.

36:02.670 --> 36:04.800
He fought to defend our borders
for four full years.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.150
When he lay dying,

36:08.752 --> 36:10.480
he was still filled with grief and fury.

36:10.768 --> 36:12.672
With his last ounce
of strength, he cried out,

36:13.280 --> 36:14.150
"Kill the enemy!

36:14.880 --> 36:15.630
Kill the enemy!"

36:19.760 --> 36:21.630
To honor your grandfather,

36:21.936 --> 36:24.048
Father bestowed
these words upon his epitaph,

36:24.710 --> 36:25.960
"Heroic and Upright."

36:28.760 --> 36:30.070
He truly deserved

36:31.230 --> 36:32.670
those three words throughout his life.

36:35.510 --> 36:36.150
Changying,

36:36.448 --> 36:38.048
you now command the Anlan Army.

36:38.160 --> 36:39.950
If you also marry
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

36:40.000 --> 36:41.776
more than half
of Great Xing's military power

36:41.780 --> 36:42.800
will fall into your hands.

36:42.816 --> 36:45.360
At court, those noble families
with their own agendas

36:45.550 --> 36:46.960
will surely unite against you.

36:47.280 --> 36:48.510
Under such immense pressure,

36:48.528 --> 36:49.616
Father, to protect you,

36:49.648 --> 36:51.690
will certainly strip you
of your military command

36:51.696 --> 36:53.952
and bring you back to the imperial
capital to serve as a court official.

36:54.030 --> 36:54.752
If that happens,

36:55.230 --> 36:56.760
you'll never again have the chance

36:56.760 --> 36:58.480
to fulfill
your grandfather's final wish.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.590
You're right.

37:11.190 --> 37:12.360
Everything you've said,

37:12.510 --> 37:13.630
I had never considered before.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.110
Thank you for your guidance.

37:17.424 --> 37:19.320
The young should aspire
to soar like great swans.

37:19.330 --> 37:21.340
They should ride swift steeds
across the open plains.

37:21.350 --> 37:22.150
You and I,

37:22.320 --> 37:23.280
shall stand side by side

37:23.840 --> 37:25.960
and fulfill our ambitions together.

37:42.192 --> 37:42.920
Your Highness!

37:45.480 --> 37:46.150
Who

37:46.360 --> 37:47.760
tried to harm Zhaoning?

37:47.760 --> 37:49.264
If she doesn't receive better treatment,

37:49.280 --> 37:51.920
I'm afraid she'll spend the rest
of her life confined to this sickbed.

37:51.960 --> 37:52.480
Your Highness,

37:52.544 --> 37:53.776
are you truly going in person?

37:53.780 --> 37:55.990
The extreme cold will worsen
the poison inside your body.

37:56.010 --> 37:57.248
The danger will be immense.

37:57.280 --> 38:01.420
♪How can you be this wonderful?♪

38:03.430 --> 38:06.370
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:06.990 --> 38:09.790
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:10.660 --> 38:17.630
♪So never uncover♪

38:17.820 --> 38:20.180
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:21.310 --> 38:24.040
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:25.000 --> 38:30.340
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:32.100 --> 38:34.920
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:35.720 --> 38:38.570
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:39.360 --> 38:42.730
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:42.990 --> 38:46.300
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:49.270 --> 38:52.710
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:53.700 --> 38:56.030
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

38:57.300 --> 39:03.060
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:04.470 --> 39:07.600
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:08.050 --> 39:11.060
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:11.170 --> 39:17.810
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:17.810 --> 39:21.480
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:22.350 --> 39:25.110
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:25.550 --> 39:28.680
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:29.120 --> 39:35.070
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:36.470 --> 39:40.020
♪You'll never♪

39:40.300 --> 39:49.770
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:15.940 --> 40:19.420
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
